  "description": "As a young girl, Wanseo survived her illness by eating the Queen Mother's sacred peach. However, her body gained a tempting peach scent that made her a target for evil spirits. While Wanseo's father is away seeking the Jade Emperor's advice on the matter, he leaves her under the protection of Baek Ho, the handsome fox spirit she has unrequited feelings for. After an incident draws them closer, Ho grows aware of his attraction to Wanseo. But what will happen to their budding romance when the emperor advises Wanseo to marry one of the spirits on his list for her safety...? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
